      "title": "嫁袁敬初",
      "summary": "旧史记袁敬初娶梁祖之妹，新史袁传明确为万安大长公主；她是袁象先之母。",
      "year": null,
      "sortOrder": 1,
      "precision": "undated",
      "sourceDate": "婚配未记年日",
      "phase": "uncertain",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "chapterId": "old-v059",
          "paragraphId": "old-v059-p12",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "fb8bb0cf88b6cebffa79635ee6daf23a36a1ab29b2a217535d387953ea7371ed",
          "excerpt": "敬初娶梁祖之妹，初封沛郡太君。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "new-v45",
          "paragraphId": "new-v45-p26",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "bda9a999586d16c40e6a1f699307bd8ea5d3df1e39cb5547770763dfa2c0adf1",
          "excerpt": "父敬初，梁太府卿、駙馬都尉，尚太祖妹，是為萬安大長公主。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "new-v13",
          "paragraphId": "new-v13-p55",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "278de10462e860ee2815e5a5aed442aa0870470e289457547ece80e6dcbe784a",
          "excerpt": "象先母為太祖妹萬安大長公主，象先乃太祖甥。"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "不据丈夫官名或象先生年倒算婚日，也不把她视为朱温的女儿。"
      ]
    },
